OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry and cloudy this      
OL,6,Fmorning, rain reaching Galloway later. 
OL,7,FThis afternoon will be cloudy with     
OL,8,Frain spreading northeast across most   
OL,9,Fparts. Fresh southerly winds along the 
OL,10,FSolway coast this morning.             
OL,12,CTonight:FRain will clear away          
OL,13,Fnortheastwards this evening. Then the  
OL,14,Frest of the night will be dry with     
OL,15,Fvariable amounts of cloud and clear    
OL,16,Fperiods. Freshening winds in the       
OL,17,Fsouthwest later.                       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
