OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,CSunday:FAfter a dry and bright start   
OL,6,Fshowery rain, possibly heavy, will     
OL,7,Fspread east for a time in the morning. 
OL,8,FMainly dry and bright in the afternoon.
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:       
OL,11,FCloudy, mild and windy on Monday with  
OL,12,Frain at times, drier in the east.      
OL,13,FEarly rain on Tuesday then mainly dry  
OL,14,Fand bright. Bright with a few showers  
OL,15,Fon Wednesday.                          
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
